                                "sense_id": "ca727376-96ac-379e-9390-7f3a2f038204",
                                "text": "As the Major entered I observed upon his person a kind of uprightness that no sober man ever had, varied with quick little steps sideways, for no good visible reason, and when he comes up to the counter he grabs it with both hands and says, ' How do—gla' meecher—hot, ain't it?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26a0412a-dcce-453d-b208-4ed0aeec7ab0",
                                "sense_id": "ca727376-96ac-379e-9390-7f3a2f038204",
                                "text": "Very pleased ter meecher, Steve."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd9a8777-0a29-4fdc-926e-5fc8ca4f5998",
                                "sense_id": "ca727376-96ac-379e-9390-7f3a2f038204",
                                "text": "Pleased to meecher, I don't think."
                            }
                        ]
